# Local-only sample directory: holds non-redistributable fixtures (license-restricted,
# login-gated, vendor SDK demos). Tracked manually in samples_local/INDEX.md but never
# committed. Mirror layout of samples/ (one subdir per format family). The tree is
# instead committed as the encrypted `samples_local.tar.gz.enc` (see
# scripts/samples_local_crypt.sh); only the passphrase below stays out of git.
/samples_local/
/samples_local.key
*.dylib
*.dll
*.a
*.lib
*.profraw
htmlcov/
